<div style="padding:10rem 5% 7rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6rem;align-items:start;">
  <div class="reveal-left">
    <span class="section-label">Contact & Location</span>
    <h1 class="section-title">Visit us in <em>New Delhi</em></h1>
    <div class="ornament"><div class="ornament-gem"></div></div>
    <p class="section-body" style="margin-top:1rem;">We'd love to hear from you. Visit us at Connaught Place, call us directly, or drop us an email — we respond to all reservation enquiries within 15 minutes.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;">
      <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;padding-bottom:1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(61,36,16,0.1);">
        <div style="width:44px;height:44px;min-width:44px;background:rgba(200,98,26,0.1);border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.1rem;">📍</div>
        <div><div style="font-size:0.65rem;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--warm-gray);margin-bottom:0.3rem;">Address</div><div style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--charcoal);">12, Connaught Place, Inner Circle, Block F,<br>New Delhi – 110001, India</div></div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;padding-bottom:1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(61,36,16,0.1);">
        <div style="width:44px;height:44px;min-width:44px;background:rgba(200,98,26,0.1);border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.1rem;">📞</div>
        <div><div style="font-size:0.65rem;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--warm-gray);margin-bottom:0.3rem;">Phone</div><a href="tel:+919876543210" style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--charcoal);text-decoration:none;">+91 98765 43210</a></div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;padding-bottom:1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(61,36,16,0.1);">
        <div style="width:44px;height:44px;min-width:44px;background:rgba(200,98,26,0.1);border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.1rem;">✉️</div>
        <div><div style="font-size:0.65rem;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--warm-gray);margin-bottom:0.3rem;">Email</div><a href="mailto:reservations@spicemandal.in" style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--charcoal);text-decoration:none;">reservations@spicemandal.in</a></div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;">
        <div style="width:44px;height:44px;min-width:44px;background:rgba(200,98,26,0.1);border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.1rem;">🚇</div>
        <div><div style="font-size:0.65rem;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--warm-gray);margin-bottom:0.3rem;">Nearest Metro</div><div style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--charcoal);">Rajiv Chowk — Blue & Yellow Line · 2 min walk</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="btn-primary" href="/reservation" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:2.5rem;">Reserve a Table →</a>
  </div>
  <div style="background:var(--charcoal);border-radius:8px;padding:2.5rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);" class="reveal-right">
    <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Send a Message</h2>
    <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(250,245,236,0.35);margin-bottom:2rem;font-weight:300;">For general enquiries, events & private dining</p>
    <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-lbl">Full Name</label><input type="text" class="form-inp" placeholder="Arjun Sharma"></div>
    <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-lbl">Email</label><input type="email" class="form-inp" placeholder="arjun@example.com"></div>
    <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-lbl">Subject</label><select class="form-sel"><option>General Enquiry</option><option>Private Dining</option><option>Wedding & Events</option><option>Corporate Booking</option><option>Press & Media</option><option>Feedback</option></select></div>
    <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-lbl">Message</label><textarea class="form-txt" placeholder="Tell us how we can help…"></textarea></div>
    <button class="form-btn" onclick="this.textContent='Message Sent ✓';this.style.background='#2a7a3a';">Send Message</button>
  </div>
</div>
